# Run directories are generated, but the cumulative trial counter and the
# holdout ledger are PERMANENT PROJECT STATE and must be committed.
# CLAUDE.md rule 4: N_trials.txt accumulates across the project's lifetime and
# is never reset. See docs/11_FINDINGS.md finding 6 (N under-counted) and
# finding 15 (holdout single-touch).
runs/*
!runs/N_trials.txt
!runs/holdout_touches.log

